<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-PRIVATISATION AGENCY OKAYS LETA SALE RULES.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-PRIVATISATION AGENCY OKAYS LETA SALE RULES.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The privatisation agency has approved the rules for the sale of state-owned news agency LETA, it said on Friday.</p>
<p>The agency said in a statement that it set a deadline of August 12 for offers to privatise the troubled agency and if there was more than offer then an auction would be held on August 23.</p>
<p>Officials have said that the government wants to attract a large investor for the agency, which has big debts and is on the verge of bankruptcy.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
